flowchart LR
  root["a trained text-to-image denoiser D(x; σ, c)<br/>a new condition y needs σ² · ∇ log p(y | x) added"]
  sampler["1 · the sampler's arithmetic<br/>no training · an approximation at every step"]
  inputs["2 · new inputs to a frozen network<br/>a side path that starts at zero"]
  weights["3 · changed weights<br/>the model's distribution itself moves"]
  cfg["classifier-free guidance<br/>D_u + w (D_c − D_u)<br/>costs coverage and contrast"]
  repl["inpainting by replacement, RePaint<br/>known half re-noised at every step<br/>costs coherence, or 10× the calls"]
  edit["SDEdit, DDIM inversion<br/>start from the image, not from noise<br/>costs a ghost, or the inverse path"]
  cn["ControlNet<br/>trainable encoder copy + zero convolutions<br/>361M parameters on SD 1.5"]
  adapt["T2I-Adapter · IP-Adapter · GLIGEN<br/>77M · 22M · a gate at tanh(0)<br/>smaller side paths into a frozen U-Net"]
  chan["inpainting and editing channels<br/>new input weights at zero<br/>SD inpainting, InstructPix2Pix"]
  ti["textual inversion<br/>one token embedding · 768 numbers<br/>cannot add what the model cannot draw"]
  lora["LoRA · Custom Diffusion<br/>W₀ + BA with B = 0 · cross-attention K, V<br/>0.8M · 19.2M parameters"]
  db["DreamBooth<br/>every weight + prior preservation<br/>costs drift, forgetting, memorised photos"]

  root -->|"estimate it while sampling"| sampler
  root -->|"learn it from paired data"| inputs
  root -->|"absorb it into the weights"| weights
  sampler -->|"guidance weight w"| cfg
  sampler -->|"the known pixels"| repl
  sampler -->|"the image to edit"| edit
  inputs -->|"edge, depth or pose map"| cn
  inputs -->|"image prompt, boxes"| adapt
  inputs -->|"mask, masked or input image"| chan
  weights -->|"a new word"| ti
  weights -->|"a low-rank update"| lora
  weights -->|"3–5 photos of a subject"| db
